{
  "description": "The extension points of the published version: the members of the public declarations that a plugin or an application implements and gives to the library, or that the library gives to them (248 points; the list they were counted from had 249 rows, with ModeFactory twice). A point is the name of a declaration or of a member, as the records of scripts/gates/lib/declarations.mjs name it. The gate fails when a point is missing from the build or from the fixed declarations of api/. The 27 points with `removed` were taken out by the change given, and are not in api/: while `pending` is true they are still in the build, and the gate fails once the build has lost one of them, so that the unit that removed it clears its `pending`; after that the gate fails if one comes back.",
